    "CLAUDE_GRAPHIFY_ENABLED": "auto",
    "_comment_graphify": "Graphify (graphifyy v0.8.25) integration drives the REAL CLI (graphify update/query/affected). Gate: CLAUDE_GRAPHIFY_ENABLED=auto|1 enables, 0 disables. Override env vars (leave unset for defaults): GRAPHIFY_BIN=<path> overrides graphify CLI; CLAUDE_GRAPHIFY_CACHE_ROOT=<dir> overrides /var/tmp/claude-graphify (MUST be OUTSIDE the repo — wrappers refuse cache-root-inside-repo); GRAPHIFY_TRIAGE_BACKEND=<gemini|claude-cli|...> forces the semantic-extraction backend (else auto-detect via API-key env vars, falling back to the keyless claude-cli backend when /usr/bin/claude is present); semantic keys like GEMINI_API_KEY/GOOGLE_API_KEY enable Gemini semantic mode. NOTE: GRAPHIFY_OUT is wrapper-internal (set to cacheDir by run_graphify_cmd so byproducts never pollute the repo) and is NOT a user override for the wrappers.",
    "_comment_anthropic": "Optional configuration below (disabled).",
    "_disabled_anthropic": "[object Object]",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_TMPDIR": "/var/tmp/claude-scratch",
    "TMPDIR": "/var/tmp/claude-scratch",
    "_comment_tmpdir": "Pinned to /var/tmp/claude-scratch because it is disk-backed (ext4); the prior /dev/shm/claude-tmp pin was tmpfs (RAM+swap) despite claiming otherwise."
  },
